    "kicker": "Method / personalization",
    "title": "One policy. Different evidence.",
    "seconds": 35,
    "notes": "Our final system uses one lightweight linear ranker, with different weights for the shopper and page context. For returning shoppers, it combines historical preferences with current activity and tastes inferred from previous requests. For new shoppers, it starts with the current session and remembers earlier visits. Product quality comes from organic purchases and views. We train ranking weights using our own recommendation feedback, and always exclude known purchases.",
